      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":882.0,"y":604.0},"guid":"9a9722d5-4e09-4a50-8e0d-75dd39cc9aac","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"270"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":1109.0,"y":-1726.0},"guid":"e736172c-df95-4cc6-919b-878ac1fc1922","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"3875"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"trumpColor","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":928.0,"y":1097.0},"guid":"8f723808-d2dc-472f-bcdb-a0625c960df3","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"3877"},{"numeric":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":60.0,"y":-446.0},"guid":"20ddcb13-1bf5-4832-9726-1d40ac80ff36","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Equal","$id":"3879"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":198.0,"y":248.0},"guid":"9096a19c-d5f3-434f-b1e7-43464bbc6090","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"3881"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":1,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":594.0,"y":-522.0},"guid":"3ba6dc71-95eb-4a30-8dc2-e12749dfbf47","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"3883"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":1235.0,"y":-1512.0},"guid":"c436fca1-6f04-40b1-b6ae-15460f93ed1e","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"3885"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":2,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":803.0,"y":-314.0},"guid":"389bdd21-8e53-4265-8d80-54cf56560751","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"3887"},{"member":{"name":"currentTrumpColor","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"DeckManager","targetTypeName":"DeckM